{'symbol': 'LW', 'date': '2022-07-20 19:30:00', 'title': 'LAMB WESTON HOLDINGS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'EAGLE, IDAHO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF LAMB WESTON HOLDINGS, INC. (NYSE: LW) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.245 PER SHARE OF LAMB WESTON COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON SEPT. 2, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON AUG. 5, 2022. ABOUT LAMB WESTON LAMB WESTON, ALONG WITH ITS JOINT VENTURE PARTNERS, IS A LEADING SUPPLIER OF FROZEN POTATO, SWEET POTATO, APPETIZER AND VEGETABLE PRODUCTS TO RESTAURANTS AND RETAILERS AROUND THE WORLD. FO'}